{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153170/extras/5e7cb8bde5f6f2c6c0c016f6e4bb6ebd.webp?t=1736048811\" width=319 height=48 /></span><br>This game is an homage to <strong>Hbomberguy</strong>'s legendary charity stream in support of Mermaids, a UK-based charity and advocacy organization that supports gender diverse &amp; transgender children and teenagers!<br><br>In this game inspired by a 1999's classic, you can...<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fight back against thieving Greyman Grifterham and his horde of beavery bullies<br></li><li>Experience the thrill (and frustration) of herding low-poly beavers into a bottomless pit<br></li><li>Play on &quot;Classic&quot; or &quot;Fair&quot; difficulty<br></li><li>Complete three levels and retrieve all money that has been stolen<br></li><li>Beat your personal high scores</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153170/extras/3c72bae3366bb29096b86876c5b706ae.webp?t=1736048811\" width=541 height=32 /></span><br>Herd beavers into the pit and collect a total of <strong>$347,137.30</strong>, to win the game!<br><br>In Classic difficulty mode, if beavers walk straight towards the hole they'll stop and not fall in! The &quot;trick&quot; is to make sure you steer them towards the hole, but not directly at it: Always mind the angle at which beavers are walking towards the pit!<br><br>If you manage to make a beaver walk closely past the hole, it's a good chance to give them a little scare: Usually, they will jump right in!<br><br><i>For a simpler way to bother the beavers, switching to the Fair difficulty mode will make beavers run straight into the pit! (If you steer them that way)</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153170/extras/a7623d13922bfc0d790daa327d5ff116.webp?t=1736048811\" width=314 height=48 /></span><br>With special thanks to the amazing <strong>Hbomberguy</strong>, <strong>Casey Explosion</strong>, <strong>Shaun</strong>, the<strong> The Skeleton Crew</strong>, and everyone who has donated time or money, to make the Mermaids stream the success it was!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"8c970bbee311a026c468dddb77b2c4a97fe31744.jpg","localized_name":"How Do I Beat Bomber Bother?!","name":"How Do I Beat Bomber Bother?!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1153170/8c970bbee311a026c468dddb77b2c4a97fe31744.jpg"},{"icon":"8c970bbee311a026c468dddb77b2c4a97fe31744.jpg","localized_name":"That's How!","name":"That's How!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1153170/8c970bbee311a026c468dddb77b2c4a97fe31744.jpg"},{"icon":"8c970bbee311a026c468dddb77b2c4a97fe31744.jpg","localized_name":"Angry Beavers","name":"Angry Beavers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1153170/8c970bbee311a026c468dddb77b2c4a97fe31744.jpg"},{"icon":"8c970bbee311a026c468dddb77b2c4a97fe31744.jpg","localized_name":"Nice.","name":"Nice.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1153170/8c970bbee311a026c468dddb77b2c4a97fe31744.jpg"},{"icon":"8c970bbee311a026c468dddb77b2c4a97fe31744.jpg","localized_name":"Beaver Botherer","name":"Beaver Botherer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1153170/8c970bbee311a026c468dddb77b2c4a97fe31744.jpg"},{"icon":"2b27e262ccfc601a8dfe56a14110592c7f6fbac3.jpg","localized_name":"Pit Stop","name":"Pit Stop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1153170/2b27e262ccfc601a8dfe56a14110592c7f6fbac3.jpg"},{"icon":"8c970bbee311a026c468dddb77b2c4a97fe31744.jpg","localized_name":"What A Pity","name":"What A Pity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/im